Package: bsst
Title: Bayesian Simulation-Based Severe Testing
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Metodi", "Latinov", , "metodilatinov@abv.bg", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools for validating Bayesian models fitted with Stan
    through simulation-based parameter recovery experiments. The package
    automates the workflow of simulating data from known parameter values,
    fitting a Bayesian model, evaluating parameter recovery, summarizing
    convergence diagnostics, and exploring model performance across simulation
    settings using designed experiments and Bayesian optimization.
